WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.071
In tutorial 9.1, you'll check
which sites link to yours.

00:00:11.685 --> 00:00:15.975
First, open Backlinks in the sidebar,
then click Run a backlink check.

00:00:18.189 --> 00:00:22.774
Next, choose how deep to look. The
full check adds new and lost links,

00:00:22.824 --> 00:00:26.884
your competitors' links, and drafted
e-mails to sites worth asking.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.225
Or pick Free sources
only. It uses no credits,

00:00:31.275 --> 00:00:34.072
and still checks each
important link on its page.

00:00:35.087 --> 00:00:38.347
Then check your competitors.
They come from your settings.

00:00:38.397 --> 00:00:42.352
Keep up to three, to find sites
that link to them but not to you.

00:00:43.382 --> 00:00:47.882
Finally, see the price in credits in
the Summary, and click Check backlinks.

00:00:47.932 --> 00:00:49.672
It takes about 5 minutes.

00:00:50.836 --> 00:00:54.491
When it's done, you get a backlink
report and a prospects file,

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:58.155
and Backlinks shows who links to
you, and what you won or lost.

00:00:59.149 --> 00:01:03.274
This check already runs in your weekly
plan: a full check once a month,

00:01:03.324 --> 00:01:06.089
and a watch for lost links
in the weeks between.

00:01:07.088 --> 00:01:10.813
So, open the backlink check, choose
the depth, check your competitors,

00:01:10.863 --> 00:01:12.019
and start the check.

00:01:14.113 --> 00:01:17.584
Next, read your backlinks,
in tutorial 9.2.
